        <p class="eyebrow">Industries</p>
        <h2 id="industries-heading">What we build for Saudi Arabia's key industries</h2>
        <p class="section-note">Practical needs sector by sector. More on the <a href="/industries/">industries page</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-table-wrap">
        <table class="price-table fit-sm">
